# Local development template. Copy to .env (git-ignored) only if you want local
# defaults; never put a real credential in a committed file.
#
# The API credential is read from the process environment only, never from any file:
#   export AI_API_KEY="<provided key>"   # DeepSeek, DashScope (Qwen), Groq (gsk_...), or OpenRouter
#
# Optional: pin the one model used for every role (see config/model_profiles.toml):
#   deepseek | qwen | qwen-coder | groq-qwen | deepseek-reasoner | qwen-cn | openrouter-deepseek
# If it is not set, interactive `make run` asks once at launch (or use make run MODEL=qwen).
# HARNESS_MODEL_PROFILE=deepseek
